2026-08-21/23, session 787ac54a.  lane/apronpop ea4a1b8 + lane/transect
(5 commits) + RULINGS 2026-08-21c/A1 (396d94b) + spec A2 (6c9b9c5) + the
apron staged solve (69d897c0, 091fdc0, a8588ab).

FIVE ARMS.  apronpop = 2026-08-21b alone.  v1 = + transect (interior
REMOVED).  v2 = A1 (interior LAW at 5 %, every ring edge strict).  v3 = A2
(ring edges interior too, unless frontage or corridor-crossing).  STAGED =
the two-sub-stage projection (movement surfaces settle first, interior
conforms with the seniors frozen).

